OL,3,GNEWSAZoo's beloved orangutan Nettie
OL,4,Adies aged 43
OL,5,
OL,6,FNettie, a much-loved Sumatran orangutan
OL,7,Fand a familiar face at Jersey Zoo for
OL,8,F15 years, has died.
OL,10,FThe 43-year-old orangutan was
OL,11,Feuthanised on Monday following
OL,12,Fveterinary advice after staff saw signs
OL,13,Fthat age-related health problems were
OL,14,Fincreasingly affecting her wellbeing,
OL,15,Fthe zoo said.
OL,17,FNettie had been receiving specialist
OL,18,Fgeriatric care for several years,
OL,19,Fincluding medication and supplements to
OL,20,Fhelp manage suspected osteoarthritis
OL,21,Fand long-standing dental issues.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
