OL,3,GNEWSAZoo's beloved orangutan Nettie
OL,4,Adies aged 43
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Nic Masters, head of veterinary
OL,7,Fservices at zoo owner Durrell Wildlife
OL,8,FConservation Trust, said: "We made a
OL,9,Fresponsible, proactive decision to end
OL,10,Fher life in a peaceful and considered
OL,11,Fway before she was in distress."
